%U A398811 2462873750000,14417914062500,84403939062500,494109265625000,2892566023437500,16933376445312500,99129712343750000
%N A398811 a(n) is the number of tilings of a 10 X 5n rectangle into Y-pentominoes (no reflections, only rotations).
%H A398811 Paolo Xausa, <a href="/A398811/b398811.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..1000</a>
%H A398811 Nicolas Bělohoubek, Karol Gryszka and Antonín Slavík, <a href="https://www.karlin.mff.cuni.cz/~slavik/papers/pentominoes.pdf">A Guided Tour to Pentomino Tilings</a>
%H A398811 <a href="/index/Rec#order_02">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (5,5).
%F A398811 a(n) = 5*a(n-1) + 5*a(n-2), for n > 3.
%F A398811 a(n) = (4/5)*((3*psi + 1)^n/(psi + 2) + (3*phi + 1)^n/(phi + 2)), where phi is the golden ratio and psi is its algebraic conjugate, for n > 3. (See the links for a proof.)
%F A398811 a(n) = (4/5)*A188168(n), for n > 3.
%F A398811 G.f: (1-4*x-2*x^2-x^3)/(1-5*x-5*x^2).
%F A398811 E.g.f.: (5*(1 + x) + 4*exp(5*x/2)*(5*cosh(3*sqrt(5)*x/2) - sqrt(5)*sinh(3*sqrt(5)*x/2)))/25. - _Stefano Spezia_, Aug 22 2026
%e A398811 a(1) = 1:
